  <metadata><name>Rich Gulch Trail to Middle Bar Bridge — Mokelumne Coast to Crest Trail</name><desc>On-foot hiking route. Dense points trace the actual trail (OpenStreetMap trail data, Nov 15, 2026) so the route follows the footpath, not roads.</desc><time>2026-11-15T17:52:00Z</time></metadata>
